ind":"announcement","title":"Mission 1: The Quest for Clean Water begins here!","summary":"Hello, Village Builders!Welcome to the very first Devlog for Farm of Hope! Today, we’re peeling back the curtain on the most critical journey in our game: Mission 1 – Drilling the First Water Well.The Story Behind the MissionIn Farm of Hope, your journey begins in a landscape that has long been forgotten by rain. The soil is parched, the crops are withered, and the community is waiting for a miracle. We believe that everything starts with water—the foundation of life, growth, and hope.In this fi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-12T09:16:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783562787","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4528420-1834602721198406","game_id":"steam-4528420","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #1: From a Real-Life Inspiring Journey to \"Farm of Hope\"","summary":"Hello everyone, and welcome to our very first Developer Blog!We are absolutely thrilled to announce that our Steam Store page is officially live. Today, for our first entry, we don't want to talk about raw code or complex mechanics. Instead, we want to share the heart, the soul, and the deep emotional spark that brought Farm of Hope to life.🌍 The Story That Changed EverythingA few years ago, a young man named Quang Linh traveled from Vietnam to a remote, sun-bleached region in Africa. He didn’t ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-08T10:31:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721198406","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4528420":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:33:30Z","status":"ok","all_sour